<title>USA: ReliaStar completes Security-Connecticut purchase.</title>
<headline>ReliaStar completes Security-Connecticut purchase.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReliaStar Financial Corp said Tuesday it completed its merger with Security-Connecticut Corp.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, Security-Connecticut shareholders will receive 0.7367 share of ReliaStar common stock per share of Security-Connecticut. Shareholders voted in favor of the merger last week.</p>
<p>ReliaStar provides life insurance and annuities, employee benefits, reinsurance and other financial products and services.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
